@base_url = http://localhost:8080

### Get All AB Tests
GET {{base_url}}/api/ab-tests

### Get AB Test by ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/ab-tests/1

### Create AB Test
POST {{base_url}}/api/ab-tests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1001,
  "gaSessionId": "ga_abc123",
  "testName": "button_color",
  "testVariant": "blue"
}

### Update AB Test
PUT {{base_url}}/api/ab-tests/1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1001,
  "gaSessionId": "ga_abc123",
  "testName": "button_color",
  "testVariant": "red"
}

### Delete AB Test
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/ab-tests/1001

### Get AB Tests by Session ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/ab-tests/session/ga_abc123